                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "404c9eeb-e8a7-4750-a6e1-eeb58fe9dcfd",
                                "sense_id": "505b2de9-af33-3fff-a208-9d82feb46b75",
                                "text": "Michael Stivic: Come on, Gloria. No one, no one, is going to deny you your constitutional rights."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e4418a6-a04d-464f-9e44-891fdfb30629",
                                "sense_id": "505b2de9-af33-3fff-a208-9d82feb46b75",
                                "text": "So we had a nice rainbow coalition of preggos and their mates — even one lesbian couple."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf2d618c-7a4f-4f97-b83c-a57ed300c908",
                                "sense_id": "505b2de9-af33-3fff-a208-9d82feb46b75",
                                "text": "2009, Joel Grus, Your Religion Is False, Brightwalton LLC, US, page 105,\nAccordingly, they tend to send their gay children off to “conversion therapy” (involving techniques ranging from clitoridectomy to shame) and their pregnant children off to single-sex maternity homes (which are full of all sorts of oddly-titillating preggo-on-preggo action, according to the videos on a website I accidentally stumbled across several times)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6d53619-d672-4c61-becb-f85c8a309ef1",
                                "sense_id": "505b2de9-af33-3fff-a208-9d82feb46b75",
                                "text": "2009, Rebeca Seitz, Scrapping Plans, B&H Publishing, US, page 306,\n“You bet!” Clay trots back into the diner, reappearing a moment later with a chair. “Here ya go, preggo.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "360469b8-d615-4ff8-9848-32a3099636f7",
